{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ימאסו</b> — The alef is in place of the doubling letter, like the manner of בזאו נהרים ארצו." "<b>יתהלכו למו</b> — Until they are not found." "And the sense of <b>ידרוך חציו</b> — the word הדורך is missing, like ויאמר ליוסף, as if it were written ידרוך הדורך חציו אליהם." "And he mentioned <b>חציו</b> — in place of his bow, for the drawing of the bow is for the sake of shooting arrows." "<b>יתמוללו</b> — like ימולל ויבש."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 58, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:09.574769016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}